of Debt: 5.0% pre-tax, 4.0% after-tax [Assumption]\n\u2022 Capital structure: net cash position \u2192 equity = 100% of capital \u2192 **WACC \u2248 10.0%** (round) [Assumption]\n\u2022 Sensitivity: WACC 9% \u2192 IV ~$63; WACC 11% \u2192 IV ~$47.\n\n**3-3. Explicit Forecast \u2014 Base Case (net-of-dilution FCF = OCF \u2212 capex \u2212 0.75\u00d7SBC)**\n*0.75\u00d7SBC reflects FY26 reality: buybacks $343M \u2248 71% of SBC $482M, keeping share count flat (+0.1%); the residual dilution is real but less than full SBC.* [Actual + Assumption]\n\n| FY | Revenue $B | Growth % | Non-GAAP OI % | SBC/Rev % | Net-dil FCF margin % | Net-dil FCF $M |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 2026A | 3.663 | +16.2 | 17.3 | 13.2 | 7.0 | 256 |\n| 2027E | 4.46 | +21.7 | 18.8 | 13.0 | 8.0 | 357 |\n| 2028E | 5.26 | +18 | 19.5 | 12.5 | 9.5 | 500 |\n| 2029E | 6.05 | +15 | 20.0 | 12.0 | 11.0 | 666 |\n| 2030E | 6.84 | +13 | 20.5 | 11.5 | 12.5 | 855 |\n| 2031E | 7.59 | +11 | 21.0 | 11.0 | 13.5 | 1,025 |\n| 2032E | 8.27 | +9 | 21.5 | 10.5 | 14.5 | 1,199 |\n| 2033E | 8.85 | +7 | 22.0 | 10.0 | 15.0 | 1,328 |\n| 2034E | 9.38 | +6 | 22.5 | 9.5 | 15.5 | 1,454 |\n| 2035E | 9.85 | +5 | 23.0 | 9.0 | 16.0 | 1,576 |\n| 2036E | 10.24 | +4 | 23.5 | 8.5 | 16.5 | 1,690 |\n\n**Driver sourcing (mandatory):**\n\u2022 FY27 revenue/Non-GAAP OI: **guided by company 2026-05-27** \u2014 $4.41\u20134.51B (+20\u201323%), OI $820\u2013860M \u2192 mid $4.46B / 18.8% [Actual]\n\u2022 FY28\u2013FY31 growth: **my assumption** \u2014 blends sell-side consensus (rev +15.9% [Estimate]), RPO +41% [Actual] giving 2-year visibility, storage TAM ~5\u20137% + share gains (IDC: outgrowing rivals [Estimate/news]).\n\u2022 FY32\u2013FY36 growth: **my assumption** \u2014 decay to terminal 4% as base scales; NOT derived from guidance.\n\u2022 SBC/Rev decline: **my assumption** \u2014 R&D headcount grows ~15% vs revenue 20%\u21924%; ratio decays 13.2%\u21928.5%. If SBC stays flat at 13%: IV falls to ~$38.\n\u2022 Capex: **my assumption**